    "title": "Van Driver Needed for USD 247 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By DeAnn Hamblin ,\n9 hours ago CHEROKEE – USD 247 Southeast is in need of a part-time van driver to transport students to and from satellite locations. Must be 21 years of age or older and have a valid driver’s license. For more information, please contact Dustin Wheeler at 620-457-8350 or email dwheeler@usd247.com. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
